{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["And YHWH said to Moshe: Come to Pharaoh — twice Moshe would warn Pharaoh in each set of three plagues, and on the third he would not warn him. And so the entire sequence: in every set of three plagues he does not warn on the third. For blood and frogs he warned; for lice he did not warn. For wild beasts and pestilence he warned; for boils he did not warn. For hail and locusts he warned; for darkness he did not warn."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:40:42.160052935Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}